  "name": "Necromancer Dark Harvester adds 3% critical strike and hit chance (#1131)",
  "contract": "Dark Harvester 807960 is a Necromancer Death talent (CharacterAdvancement 30821, ClassType 25 = class 23, Tab 59 Death, TalentEssenceCost 1). Its client description reads 'Increases your critical strike and hit chance by $s1%.' Effect 0 is SPELL_AURA_MOD_CRIT_PCT (290) and effect 1 SPELL_AURA_ASCENSION_MOD_HIT_CHANCE_ALL_PCT (333), both BasePoints 2 + DieSides 1 = 3 on the caster; no Necromancer contract rewrites either. Aura 290 adds its amount to melee and ranged crit (Player::UpdateWeaponDependentCritAuras) and to every school's spell crit (Player::UpdateSpellCritChance); aura 333 is counted in m_modMeleeHitChance, m_modRangedHitChance and m_modSpellHitChance (Player::Update*HitChances). Learning it must raise Shadow and Frost spell crit, melee crit, melee hit and spell hit by exactly 3 percentage points, and unlearning it must restore them. Player::UpdateCritPercentage clamps melee crit at zero after a weapon-skill penalty, so a large fixture melee crit rating keeps that baseline well above the clamp.",
